From ff4b1feb6dad7198dee64843d0c93c68a4e8ce0d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yaroslav Kostiuk <yaroslav0378@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 03:27:06 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Scrolled content reused while scrolling: cull rectangle in
 steps, wholly-inside elements keyed without it, no layer limit

---
 Cargo.lock                         | 41 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 packages/blitz-paint/src/layers.rs |  5 +++-
 packages/blitz-paint/src/render.rs | 24 ++++++++++++++---
 3 files changed, 66 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

